WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:23.846
"Bird, I'm going to the beach!" said Kip.

2
00:00:23.847 --> 00:00:25.847
"Want to come with me?"

3
00:00:25.848 --> 00:00:28.160
"Of course," said Bird.

4
00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:31.834
"I love the beach."

5
00:00:31.835 --> 00:00:40.241
"I can't wait to get there," said Bird.

6
00:00:40.242 --> 00:00:42.812
"I'm going to play in the water."

7
00:00:42.813 --> 00:00:45.797
"I'm not going to play," said Kip.

8
00:00:45.798 --> 00:00:48.137
"I have work to do."

9
00:00:48.138 --> 00:00:51.359
"You have work to do?" asked Bird.

10
00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:57.373
"Yes," said Kip.

11
00:00:57.374 --> 00:01:00.991
"I'm going to build a boat."

12
00:01:00.992 --> 00:01:05.025
"You're going to build a boat?" asked Bird.

13
00:01:05.026 --> 00:01:07.860
"Are you going sailing?"

14
00:01:07.861 --> 00:01:13.757
"No," said Kip. "We are going sailing."

15
00:01:13.758 --> 00:01:16.565
"On the ocean?" asked Bird.

16
00:01:16.566 --> 00:01:21.771
"Yes," said Kip.

17
00:01:21.772 --> 00:01:26.274
"On the ocean. We're going to have an adventure!"

18
00:01:26.275 --> 00:01:36.511
"I'm not so sure about this," said Bird.

19
00:01:36.512 --> 00:01:42.836
"Do you know how to build a boat?" asked Bird.

20
00:01:42.837 --> 00:01:46.780
"I think so," said Kip.

21
00:01:46.781 --> 00:01:51.966
"How hard could it be?"
